// PY-A: 步长切片 `s[start:end:step]` —— `s[::2]` / `s[::-1]` / `s[4:1:-1]`
//   此前 3 段切片**解析失败**，会静默丢弃其后所有语句（fail-open）
// expect: bcd
// expect: ace
// expect: fedcba
// expect: edc
// expect: [1, 3]
// expect: [4, 3, 2, 1]
s = "abcdef"
print(s[1:4])
print(s[::2])
print(s[::-1])
print(s[4:1:-1])

a = [1, 2, 3, 4]
print(a[::2])
print(a[::-1])
